# T7. A recording ends by itself at 55 s (RECORD_MAX_MS: the contract's 60 s less a margin): a stop, the arm holds, and the
# terminal saves it. It ends with nothing grasped, so no "Let go?" follows. A recording that ends with a fault is
# never saved.
expect motion mode ready
key torque-on-left
wait 2100
key c
expect motion torque left on
key leader-match-left
wait 100
key record-left
wait 2100
key c
expect motion recording started sim_taught
key leader-sweep-left
expect 56000 motion recording limit sim_taught
expect motion command teleop.start stopped operator_cli
key record-finish
expect motion skill-saved sim_taught
absent 2500 motion target gripper.release
key skills-list
expect sim skills sim_sample_handover:ok sim_taught:ok
# A fault mid-recording: not saved.
key leader-match-left
wait 100
key record-left
wait 2100
key c
expect motion recording started sim_taught
wait 500
key stale-left
expect motion fault feedback_stale arm_left
expect motion recording discarded sim_taught
key record-finish
expect sim record-finish not saved: the recording ended with a fault
key q
